{"id":"88","title":"Media and Communication Vocabulary","goal":"Name a communication channel, device, online action, or reading item and explain what you need.","language":"en","study":[{"id":"88-study-0","title":"Start here","blocks":[{"id":"ch88-b0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Choose terms for your own task first. A word may name a thing, an action, or both: “Send a message” and “Message me” use "},{"text":"message","italic":true},{"text":" differently."}],"span":[6,6],"phraseIds":["ch88-p78472280696446","ch88-p11761608684829"]}],"line":6,"ja":"","theme":"media-vocabulary"},{"id":"88-study-1","title":"Calls and messages","blocks":[{"id":"ch88-b1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"You "},{"text":"call","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"text","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"email","emphasis":true},{"text":", or "},{"text":"make a video call","emphasis":true},{"text":". A "},{"text":"voicemail","emphasis":true},{"text":" is a recorded message left for someone. To "},{"text":"take a message","emphasis":true},{"text":" is to record information for another person. To "},{"text":"put someone on hold","emphasis":true},{"text":" is to pause their connection while they wait; to "},{"text":"transfer a call","emphasis":true},{"text":" is to connect it elsewhere. "},{"text":"Speakerphone","emphasis":true},{"text":" lets a call play through a speaker. "},{"text":"Reply","emphasis":true},{"text":" answers a message; "},{"text":"forward","emphasis":true},{"text":" sends received content onward."}],"span":[10,10],"phraseIds":["ch88-p99493541949267","ch88-p158083890318326","ch88-p58406260487387","ch88-p273499442595594","ch88-p205331401282168","ch88-p266063473347607","ch88-p80420608651454","ch88-p249501290504620","ch88-p84906959620560","ch88-p7232126827368","ch88-p94726258568840"]}],"line":8,"ja":"","theme":"media-vocabulary"},{"id":"88-study-2","title":"Devices and connection","blocks":[{"id":"ch88-b2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"A "},{"text":"desktop","emphasis":true},{"text":" usually stays at a desk; a "},{"text":"laptop","emphasis":true},{"text":" is a portable computer; a "},{"text":"tablet","emphasis":true},{"text":" has a flat touch screen. "},{"text":"Phone / cell phone / smartphone","emphasis":true},{"text":" can describe a handheld communication device, with "},{"text":"smartphone","italic":true},{"text":" emphasizing its computing functions. A "},{"text":"smartwatch","emphasis":true},{"text":" is a watch with digital functions."}],"span":[14,14],"phraseIds":["ch88-p139596843356670","ch88-p252183052658590","ch88-p158197632610488","ch88-p60835170673072","ch88-p89166734445684"]},{"id":"ch88-b3","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Keyboard","emphasis":true},{"text":" has keys for entering information; "},{"text":"mouse","emphasis":true},{"text":" controls a pointer; "},{"text":"mouse pad","emphasis":true},{"text":" is a surface used beneath it. A "},{"text":"webcam","emphasis":true},{"text":" is a camera used with a computer or similar device. "},{"text":"Charging cable","emphasis":true},{"text":" connects a device for charging; "},{"text":"battery level","emphasis":true},{"text":" reports remaining charge. "},{"text":"Signal","emphasis":true},{"text":" describes reception. A "},{"text":"router","emphasis":true},{"text":" directs network traffic; "},{"text":"Wi-Fi","emphasis":true},{"text":" describes wireless networking; an "},{"text":"internet provider","emphasis":true},{"text":" supplies internet service. A "},{"text":"hotspot","emphasis":true},{"text":" provides a connection point for devices."}],"span":[16,16],"phraseIds":["ch88-p106189553666191","ch88-p186001684335330","ch88-p142722443758517","ch88-p24208909569079","ch88-p186203362394471","ch88-p138667229361794","ch88-p115810215195567","ch88-p259712177462592","ch88-p266634150403125","ch88-p183719686342546","ch88-p39130570791446"]}],"line":12,"ja":"","theme":"media-vocabulary"},{"id":"88-study-3","title":"Accounts and actions","blocks":[{"id":"ch88-b4","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"An "},{"text":"account","emphasis":true},{"text":" is a user's access or record with a service. "},{"text":"Settings","emphasis":true},{"text":" control options; a "},{"text":"menu","emphasis":true},{"text":" presents choices. A "},{"text":"password","emphasis":true},{"text":" is a secret used in access. A "},{"text":"link","emphasis":true},{"text":" points to another online location. "},{"text":"Click","emphasis":true},{"text":" commonly describes selecting with a pointer; "},{"text":"tap","emphasis":true},{"text":" selecting by touch. You "},{"text":"browse","emphasis":true},{"text":" pages, "},{"text":"download","emphasis":true},{"text":" data to your device, "},{"text":"upload","emphasis":true},{"text":" data from it, and "},{"text":"stream","emphasis":true},{"text":" content as it is delivered. "},{"text":"Cookies","emphasis":true},{"text":" are data a website stores through a browser; they are not all the same as passwords or computer viruses."}],"span":[20,20],"phraseIds":["ch88-p179511494687308","ch88-p49878258500272","ch88-p7509226625940","ch88-p138826738807566","ch88-p138955465240096","ch88-p149992305307349","ch88-p179785758339596","ch88-p94274102800870","ch88-p272935711870760","ch88-p183814883810430","ch88-p174932863002188","ch88-p78113646493926"]}],"line":18,"ja":"","theme":"media-vocabulary"},{"id":"88-study-4","title":"Social media and reading","blocks":[{"id":"ch88-b5","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"A "},{"text":"post","emphasis":true},{"text":" is published content. A "},{"text":"follower","emphasis":true},{"text":" follows an account; "},{"text":"like","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"share","emphasis":true},{"text":", and "},{"text":"comment","emphasis":true},{"text":" name actions or responses. "},{"text":"DM","emphasis":true},{"text":" means direct message. "},{"text":"Livestream","emphasis":true},{"text":" is a live online broadcast. "},{"text":"Scroll","emphasis":true},{"text":" moves through content. "},{"text":"Block","emphasis":true},{"text":" restricts interaction under a platform's rules; "},{"text":"troll","emphasis":true},{"text":" can describe someone deliberately provoking others. "},{"text":"Hashtag","emphasis":true},{"text":" is a label beginning with #; "},{"text":"selfie","emphasis":true},{"text":" is a self-taken photo. "},{"text":"Influencer","emphasis":true},{"text":" describes someone whose online presence can influence an audience. "},{"text":"Viral","emphasis":true},{"text":" describes content spreading widely, not a literal medical virus."}],"span":[24,24],"phraseIds":["ch88-p124404431011175","ch88-p19494493931364","ch88-p203054602800476","ch88-p33957816565135","ch88-p121359070566443","ch88-p120610336089734","ch88-p23774186114020","ch88-p99569063240184","ch88-p44934088071373","ch88-p197433068632141","ch88-p72416058529706","ch88-p227038369240","ch88-p171665552453888","ch88-p30725054056693"]},{"id":"ch88-b6","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"A "},{"text":"podcast","emphasis":true},{"text":" is an episode-based media program. "},{"text":"Headline","emphasis":true},{"text":" titles a news item; an "},{"text":"article","emphasis":true},{"text":" is a piece of writing. "},{"text":"Magazine","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"newspaper","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"book","emphasis":true},{"text":", and "},{"text":"e-reader","emphasis":true},{"text":" describe publications or a device for reading them. A "},{"text":"subscription","emphasis":true},{"text":" gives ongoing access or delivery under stated terms. An "},{"text":"emoji","emphasis":true},{"text":" is a small graphic symbol; an "},{"text":"abbreviation","emphasis":true},{"text":" is a shortened form."}],"span":[26,26],"phraseIds":["ch88-p77082727819037","ch88-p240224851756467","ch88-p119883037100205","ch88-p228890035846191","ch88-p180141769928463","ch88-p240446357881826","ch88-p90547272053132","ch88-p120890776166355","ch88-p104492914356357","ch88-p223883973263282"]}],"line":22,"ja":"","theme":"media-vocabulary"},{"id":"88-words","title":"Words & phrases","blocks":[{"id":"88-glossary","type":"vocabulary","phraseIds":["ch88-v0","ch88-v1","ch88-v2","ch88-v3"]}]}],"practice":[{"id":"88-practice-0","title":"Take your turn","blocks":[{"id":"ch88-b7","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Fictional tasks: send a photo privately; join a video appointment; read a newspaper article; send a received email to a colleague."}],"span":[30,30]},{"id":"ch88-b8","type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"number":1,"runs":[{"text":"Choose the relevant channel and action for two tasks. Explain the choice."}],"id":"ch88-b8-0"},{"number":2,"runs":[{"text":"Hide the definitions. Contrast upload/download, reply/forward, or article/headline using your own example."}],"id":"ch88-b8-1"},{"number":3,"runs":[{"text":"Describe one device or connection need in a short sentence. Alone, say it; with someone else, let them identify the need."}],"id":"ch88-b8-2"}],"span":[32,34]}],"line":30,"ja":"","theme":"media-vocabulary","answers":[{"id":"ch88-b9","type":"answer","runs":[{"text":"Possibilities:","emphasis":true},{"text":" “I'll send a direct message with the photo.” “I need a webcam for the video call.” “I'll forward the email.” Check that direction, recipient, and action are clear. Actual account, security, or platform instructions belong to the specific service; the following lessons develop the communication tasks."}],"span":[36,36]}]}],"phrases":[{"id":"ch88-p78472280696446","en":"Send a message","section":"88-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"phrase","studyId":"ch88-p78472280696446"},{"id":"ch88-p11761608684829","en":"Message me","section":"88-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch88-p11761608684829"},{"id":"ch88-p99493541949267","en":"call","section":"88-study-1","context":"Calls and messages","kind":"word","studyId":"ch88-p99493541949267"},{"id":"ch88-p158083890318326","en":"text","section":"88-study-1","context":"